<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13989" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπότᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lengthening, prolongation,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσων ἔστιν ἀ. τῆς φωνῆς,</span> i.e.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσων ἀποτείνεται ἡ φωνή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				545a17
			</span></i>. cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>de An.</u>
				420b8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stretching out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς χειρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.101
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ποδῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.670d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετάνου ἴδιον ἡ ἐς εὐθὺ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					1.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>distension,</i> of the breast, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>reference,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀ. πρὸς Κλυταιμήστραν</span>
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1070
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				35.28
			</span></i>,al.</div>
